  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the grant instrument &#x2018;Policy Framework for Strengthening Civil Society&#x2019;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In November 2019 the Ministry of Foreign Affairs published the grant instrument &#x2018;Policy Framework for Strengthening Civil Society&#x2019;. Under this grant instrument, a total of 48 partnerships started their 5-year programmes on 1 January 2021 (to 31 December 2025), in a total of 69 countries.</narrative>
  </description>
